.git
.github
tmp/
bin/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
# Credentials. `.env` alone matched only the literal name, which stopped
# covering anything once the secrets moved into .env.local — the glob is
# what keeps them out of the builder stage and the local BuildKit cache.
# The committed, secret-free layers (.env.defaults, .env.<env>) are
# excluded too; the build does not read them.
.env*
mise.local.toml
mise.*.local.toml
docs/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
justfile
compose.yaml
sqlc.yaml
mise.toml
mise.*.toml
*_test.go
.editorconfig
.golangci.yml
.gitignore
